        "Speaker": [
          "The Million Family March"
        ],
        "Location": [
          "Washington D.C."
        ],
        "Message": [
          "celebrate family unity and racial and religious harmony ; as well as to address other issues , including abortion , capital punishment , health care , education , welfare and Social Security reform , substance abuse prevention , and overhaul of the World Bank and International Monetary Fund"
        ]
